Package: fcitx5-bami
Architecture: any
Depends: fcitx5 (>= 5.0.14), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: fcitx5-bamboo
Description: Vietnamese input method for Fcitx 5 (Telex, VNI, VIQR)
 Bami types Vietnamese with Telex variants, VNI, VIQR and the MS layout. It
 edits the application's text through surrounding-text where that is provably
 safe and falls back to preedit everywhere else (XIM, terminals, selections).
 .
 It embeds a Go runtime, so it cannot be loaded together with fcitx5-bamboo.
